    "body": "I don't see any ambiguity here. None of the quotes above state that tokenizer can't emit  more tokens **by request** as previous token is processed by a tree construction stage.\r\n\r\nHowever, the incorrect part is that we are asking for the next token before switching tokenizer to the RCDATA state. ",
