    "body": "@domenic Just my two cents, yes it does appear that swapping steps 2 and 3 should resolve the issue.\r\n\r\nThere are only two places where \"next token\" is used: [after a `textarea` start tag](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/parsing.html#parsing-main-inbody:next-token-2) and [after a `pre` or `listing` start tag](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/parsing.html#parsing-main-inbody:next-token). In both places, it's used to ignore a potential new line. Since `pre` can contain other elements, it doesn't need to switch to the `RCDATA` state. So it appears that this issue is isolated to `textarea`.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
